<title>UK: Glaxo gets UK approval for Romozin drug.</title>
<headline>Glaxo gets UK approval for Romozin drug.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Glaxo Wellcome Plc said on Thursday it had received approval from the UK's regulatory Medicines Control Agency to market Romozin (troglitazone), a drug for treating non-insulin dependent diabetes.</p>
</text>
